    "title": "pandas.tseries.offsets.Micro.normalize — pandas 3.1.0.dev0+1386.gcb2086a1a4 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.Micro.normalize#\n\n- Micro.normalize#\n- Return boolean whether the frequency can align with midnight. This is True for offsets that round the result of a DateOffset addition down to the previous midnight. See also \n  - `tseries.offsets.DateOffset`\n  - The standard kind of date increment.\n Examples >>> pd.offsets.Hour(5).normalize False >>> pd.offsets.Day(5).normalize False",
